        },
        {
          "text": "Maz’ Uhoraho abarira Yosuwa, at’ Uyu musi ngira ntangure kugukuza imbere y’Abisirayeli bose, kugira ngo bamenye yuko ndi kumwe nawe nk’uko nāmana na Mose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
