            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maz’ abaherezi barerura isandugu y’ Uhoraho Nyen’ isi yose ni bashinga ibirenge mu mazi ya Yorodani, amazi yarwo ava ruguru aca yīmīrwa, yirundanye.",
          "type": "text",
